# Ornery Tumblewagg {2}{G} (2/2, Saddle 2): at the beginning of combat on Bot1's turn it puts a +1/+1 counter on target creature (itself here: one counter in
# turn 1's combat, a second in turn 3's). Turn 3: Grizzly Bears (power 2) is tapped to saddle it, it attacks saddled and its trigger doubles the two counters
# on itself to four (6 damage: Bot2 20 -> 14). Turn 5: not saddled, so the attack doubles nothing; only the combat counter is added (five counters, 7 power,
# Bot2 14 -> 7). Saddle 2 is refused with a lone Memnite (power 1).

